stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Acquired: SET NX succeeds
    Acquired --> Working: render tiles
    Working --> Released: finish before the TTL
    Working --> Zombie: TTL expires first
    Zombie --> Released: write, then DEL
    note right of Zombie
      The process cannot tell it is here.
      Every local variable still says
      "I own lock:S2A-0007".
      Only the resource knows.
    end note
    note right of Released
      Under fencing the write from
      Zombie is refused here, and
      the process finds out.
    end note
    Released --> [*]
